{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-15_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-15","title":"感染者之盾-2","storyCode":"7-17","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"d6789925a4ee388f0037691e50f67110d578d111aaf2f57fbd67ffc1f87c143d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在罗德岛一行的紧密配合与强大火力之下，敌人尚未反应过来就被各个击破。\n然而，紧要关头，爱国者终于出现。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第三传令兵，解除！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第七传令兵，成功摧毁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"第八传令兵，截获。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，立刻展开佯攻！用你的法术扩大影响范围，直接种进他们神经系统里也可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"把所有敌人都拉出去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......太艰难了。各位都还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还算没问题......但......真的太激烈了。我再怎么也没搞过这种规模的战斗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这回要是能回得去，我想放假！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好。我一定批准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但首先......先把这支小队吃下来！在这之后，提薪、长假、特派，都可以！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"有敌军！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"别被扰乱步调！重整队形！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"东面出口正在激烈交火？别轻举妄动。我们缓步推过去，不要让敌人有可乘之机！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"这战术不像乌萨斯，也不像炎。怎么回事？这次是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"长年伏击乌萨斯军，现在轮到我们被设计？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"没有发生实质上的战斗？......孬种！小看游击队要付出代价！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"小心祭坛！大尉给我们涂上的保护只能减轻影响。他叮嘱多次，如果不是必要，别走那里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"传令兵，快通知其他队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......没回音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"迫击炮手们呢？魔族佬呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"等一会儿。这里有事情不对劲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第十二组传令兵，摧毁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"游击队战士开始收紧队伍了！现在是我们通过的最好机会！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不！可能是陷阱！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。迷迭香，我们用法术搜索附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我够不到。敌人......有东西挡住了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹术师。只有他们有针对迷迭香这类法术的反制手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那交给我......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，还能支撑多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们会提速。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我找到了。是的。在他们依靠的建筑物内部，藏有许多狙击手和术师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他们很平静......有一些激昂。但一点也不狂热。他们......坚守着据点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士说得对，那确实是陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在你的位置附近了。我来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"能做到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能。我不粉碎整栋楼，我只破坏他们在的那层的地形，不然他们会打扰我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，我可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，迷迭香......我知道你能行。一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅会佩服我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听煌说，很少能有人让阿米娅佩服呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"佩服？啊......好像是说尊敬？不，我还不太会炎国的语言。应该是一个意思吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道呀，阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事。因为我从一开始就很“佩服”迷迭香了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香真的很厉害。我的话，我克制不住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"失去和孤独。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能像迷迭香这样能忍受这些。我忍受不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅骗人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过我没什么关系。阿米娅就算骗人，也是阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"佩服我......我这样的人，也行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你说的，迷迭香。就因为迷迭香是迷迭香，我很尊敬你。无论是作为精英干员的你还是作为朋友的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，加油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，加油。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"还没出现？他们在等什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不行！绝不允许离开这片区域！只要他们出现，我们就立刻反击！不能再失去更多联络人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。对面建筑物顶端站着的，是敌人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......猫？是只小菲林......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"传令兵！快通知术师！敌人在街道另一侧的建筑物上布置了术师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要摧毁她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——剑？武器？她从空中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？漂浮在空中的武器？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从这里，划到那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用手......抓住。用剑，划开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......就像横切开土豆。"},{"type":"narration","text":"就像横切开土豆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！到我身边来！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"整栋楼被......拦腰划开？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香在摧毁游击队的伏击点。当心落石！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......那究竟是什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我假设你问的是迷迭香的法术。你看了这么多次，也许现在好向你解释一些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那是被她自己塑造成型的精神状态。你可以理解成迷迭香拥有“无法被观察、无法被施加作用的巨大形体”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"无形延伸了她的触感。她能抓握，挤压，拈起，以及甩开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但相对于她的精神主观，这种法术实际上缺乏客观体现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会被它施力，却不能对它施加力，也只能通过特殊的源石技艺析出“它确实存在”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"难理解也无所谓，这可能不是你的领域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在被交予武器之前，迷迭香会造成更大程度的破坏。被移动城邦碾过般的光景，除了废墟，就只留下废墟中跪地大哭的幼年女性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那种情况无论如何都不该再发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了。指挥部队马上就会出现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"公园废墟的喷泉。底下应该建有水道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"竟藏身在那样毫不起眼的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......栖身灰鬃峰七天七夜，连最强盛时的征战骑士都被他欺骗的那场伏击战，或许也是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"就是现在，我们走。Dr.{@nickname}，事不宜迟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，停止交火。找好隐蔽，现在我需要你专注提供通讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra-2，记录好我们所有的交谈。一字不落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第十四组传令兵，成功截获。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，凯尔希医生。我准备好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（你没事吧......张嘴！看我！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（好，你醒着。我还好。没关系。你藏好，别被找到......我们要靠你重新组织队伍。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（我知道。我们来对抗敌人。你别出声！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（没事，我没受伤。这点小石子儿，比起乌萨斯人的破城矛，小意思。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（别惊慌！我能拦下来，你得找机会！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你们！还在看什么！不敢进攻吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你们是哪国的部队，怎么现在不敢强攻了？害怕爱国者的血统和他的巫术吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有让你们想起和萨卡兹打仗的时候？那么比萨卡兹多那么多人，明明还打得赢，最后却必定会死伤无数！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们不止这点力气！你连我们的盾、我们的铠甲都打不穿！你在永不倒下的爱国者面前，什么都不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯最伟大的战士......不用枪也不用盾牌，光是踩踏，就叫你们粉身碎骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......一文不值！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的战士很快就会重新聚集在这里！你们一个都别想跑。整合运动会让你们吃尽苦头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些压迫者......奴役我们感染者的人！你们必定会被整合运动吞没的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合运动也许已经背离你们了，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——小女孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......两个......感染者小女孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你们干什么？！你们玩什么把戏！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"让一让。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你身后的那个，我要破坏他背后的装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为就因为你长这样，我就会对你手下留情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看爱国者的盾卫！我们是感染者的盾......我站在这里，就是为了挡住你的攻击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢攻击感染者，我就会生生掐死你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那我只能用武器说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你就是刚才那只猫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你的剑......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"传令兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（卫士，你快走！去通知其他人！我没关系！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（那是你的职责，不是我的！！你必须活下来！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"来啊，你打得穿这面盾吗？你捅得穿我的护甲吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。我没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会让他死。但他可能再也站不起来。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"等——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。扎穿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，不能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么......徒手打偏了我的剑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......手......很麻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候走到这里的？我没感受到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不。咦......还是说......我以为是建筑倒塌的感觉，只是你走近了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你一个人，不，你和你的队伍......连成一座......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，收队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，这是命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游击队战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"大尉......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做得，够好。你走，归队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于，你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的我，不管，你们身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，攻击我的战士，你们，死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"身份是无所谓，但立场呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，无关乎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......博卓卡斯替。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"久违了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......凯尔希，女勋爵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
